---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Reviews
description: What travelers say about trips with Milena and Onyx World Travel.
---
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>What my travelers say</h1>
    <p class="lead">The best review is a friend who comes back for the next trip.{% if reviews.length or site.draft %} Here's what a few of them have to say.{% endif %}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-white">
  <div class="wrap">
    {%- if reviews.length or site.draft %}
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      {%- if reviews.length %}
      {%- for review in reviews %}
      <figure class="card quote">
        <blockquote><p>{{ review.quote }}</p></blockquote>
        <figcaption>{{ review.name }}, {{ review.trip }}</figcaption>
      </figure>
      {%- endfor %}
      {%- elif site.draft %}
      {%- for i in range(4) %}
      <figure class="card quote quote-ph">
        <blockquote><p>{% ph "A sentence or two from a past traveler, used with their permission" %}</p></blockquote>
        <figcaption>{% ph "First name, Trip and year" %}</figcaption>
      </figure>
      {%- endfor %}
      {%- endif %}
    </div>
    {%- else %}
    <p class="lead">My first reviews are on their way. In the meantime, I'd love to tell you about my trips myself: <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a>.</p>
    {%- endif %}
    <div class="card more-card space-above">
      <h2 class="h3">Traveled with me before?</h2>
      <p>I'd love to hear how it went. <a href="/contact/">Send me a note</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
